Future group information record (UniFFI exported)

Represents contract/option group information including quote currency type
and contract type (linear/inverse).

Corresponds to `FutureGroupInfo` in Kotlin:
```kotlin
data class FutureGroupInfo (
var text: String?,
var ccyType: String?,
var ctType: String,
var sort: String? = ""
)
```

**Note:** This record is exported via UniFFI for iOS/Android native usage.

A single display item with title and value

Similar to `AvgPriceItem`, pairs a localized label (CDKey) with formatted value.

# Example

```ignore
let item = AdjustMarginItem::with_cd_key(
"pr_trade_subtitle_max_additional_amt_increase",
DisplayString::Simple("500.5 USDT".to_string()),
);
```

